    {
      "title": "Eを底にした指数減衰（毎フレーム一定割合で減る）",
      "description": "<p>毎フレーム <code>係数 = E ** (-k)</code> を掛けると、値は指数的に0へ近づきます（減衰）。</p><p>下のアニメーションは「指数減衰（<code>e^{-kt}</code>）」と「線形減少」の違いを同じ初期値で比較します。</p><iframe sandbox='allow-scripts' style='width:100%;max-width:560px;height:260px;border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:10px;display:block' srcdoc='<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=utf-8><style>html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#fff;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}.wrap{padding:12px}.top{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.btn{font-size:12px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #999;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f7f7;cursor:pointer}.grid{margin-top:10px;display:grid;gap:10px}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr 64px;gap:8px;align-items:center}.lab{font-size:12px;color:#333}.bar{height:14px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;background:#fafafa}.fill{height:100%;width:0%}.val{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:12px;text-align:right}.ctrl{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#333;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}input[type=range]{width:220px}</style></head><body><div class=wrap><div class=top><div class=title>指数減衰 v(t)=v0·e^{-kt}（毎フレーム係数を掛ける）</div><button class=btn id=reset>Reset</button></div><div class=grid><div class=row><div class=lab>指数</div><div class=bar><div class=fill id=exp></div></div><div class=val id=expv>0.00</div></div><div class=row><div class=lab>線形</div><div class=bar><div class=fill id=lin></div></div><div class=val id=linv>0.00</div></div></div><div class=ctrl><div>k: <span id=kv></span></div><input id=k type=range min=0.02 max=0.6 step=0.01 value=0.15><div>係数 e^{-k}: <span id=coef></span></div></div></div><script>(function(){const expEl=document.getElementById(`exp`);const linEl=document.getElementById(`lin`);const expV=document.getElementById(`expv`);const linV=document.getElementById(`linv`);const kEl=document.getElementById(`k`);const kV=document.getElementById(`kv`);const coef=document.getElementById(`coef`);const reset=document.getElementById(`reset`);let v0=100;let t=0;let running=true;function fmt(n){return (Math.round(n*100)/100).toFixed(2)}function step(){if(!running)return;const k=Number(kEl.value);kV.textContent=fmt(k);const c=Math.E**(-k);coef.textContent=fmt(c);const vExp=v0*(Math.E**(-k*t));const vLin=Math.max(0,v0-(v0*0.02*t));expEl.style.width=(vExp/v0*100)+`%`;linEl.style.width=(vLin/v0*100)+`%`;expV.textContent=fmt(vExp);linV.textContent=fmt(vLin);t+=1;requestAnimationFrame(step)}reset.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{t=0});kEl.addEventListener(`input`,()=>{t=0});requestAnimationFrame(step)})();</script></body></html>'></iframe>",
      "code": [
        "[State -2, 減衰率を事前計算]",
        "Type = VarSet",
        "Trigger1 = !Time",
        "FV = 10",
        "Value = E ** (-0.10) ; 1フレームあたり約0.9048倍",
        "",
        "[State -2, 速度を指数減衰させる]",
        "Type = VelMul",
        "Trigger1 = 1",
        "X = FVar(10)",
        "Y = FVar(10)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "自然対数との関係（Ln と Log(E, x)）",
      "description": "<p>自然対数（底が <code>E</code> の対数）は、<code>Ln(x)</code> と <code>Log(E, x)</code> のどちらでも表せます。</p>",
      "code": [
        "[State -2, xを用意]",
        "Type = VarSet",
        "Trigger1 = !Time",
        "FV = 0",
        "Value = 10.0",
        "",
        "[State -2, Ln(x)]",
        "Type = VarSet",
        "Trigger1 = !Time",
        "FV = 1",
        "Value = Ln(FVar(0))",
        "",
        "[State -2, Log(E, x)]",
        "Type = VarSet",
        "Trigger1 = !Time",
        "FV = 2",
        "Value = Log(E, FVar(0))",
        "",
        "[State -2, 表示]",
        "Type = DisplayToClipboard",
        "Trigger1 = 1",
        "Text = \"x=%f | Ln(x)=%f | Log(E,x)=%f\"",
        "Params = FVar(0), FVar(1), FVar(2)"
      ]
    }
